{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>ואת הצפוני</b> — the army of the locust that came from the north." "And the sense of <b>אל ארץ ציה</b> — that it will find nothing to eat." "<b>הקדמוני</b> — it is the eastern one, and <b>האחרון</b> the western one, and both are opposite Jerusalem. And behold, when they are in a desolate land they will die." "<b>צחנתו</b> — like <b>באשו</b> (his stench), and it has no companion; rather the meaning is duplicated."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:35.983910762Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}